index 000000000..7ecfc931f
--- /dev/null
+++ b/patches/0070-media-intel-ipu6-support-IPU6-PSYS-FW-trace-dump-for.patch
@@ -0,0 +1,134 @@
+From f365735ea4b498870c456759fc756a1a332faaab Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
+From: hepengpx <pengpengx.he@intel.com>
+Date: Fri, 16 Jan 2026 02:01:37 -0700
+Subject: [PATCH 70/77] media: intel-ipu6: support IPU6 PSYS FW trace dump for
+ upstream driver
+
